										  font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
										  color:#222222;">Dear <strong>{{LEAD_NAME}}</strong>,</p> <p style="margin:0 0 18px 0;
										  font-size:18px;
										  line-height:1.5;
										  font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
										  color:#222222;">Thank you for completing the Client Agreement for <strong>{{OPPORTUNITY_NAME}}</strong>.</p> <p style="margin:0 0 22px 0;
